{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="brand"><a href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a></div>
    <nav>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="about.html">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a></li>
        <li><a href="approach.html">How I Work</a></li>
        <li><a href="fees.html">Fees &amp; Plans</a></li>
        <li><a href="faq.html">Q&amp;A</a></li>
        <li><a class="cta" href="book.html">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></li>
        <li><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero reveal">
      <div class="pattern" role="presentation"></div>
      <div class="container">
        <h1>{{TAGLINE}}</h1>
        <p class="lead">Support that helps you notice patterns and test small changes—so decisions feel more manageable, not more overwhelming.</p>
        <a class="primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="framework reveal" id="framework">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>How I structure our work</h2>
        <p>We begin with a practical map: what’s happening now, what you most want to change, and a few experiments you can try between sessions. Sessions are collaborative and focused on what moves you forward.</p>
        <ul class="pill-list">
          <li><strong>Map</strong> — understand the context</li>
          <li><strong>Try</strong> — small experiments you can do at home</li>
          <li><strong>Adjust</strong> — refine what helps</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="story reveal" id="about">
      <div class="container">
        <aside class="bio">
          <h3>About your clinician</h3>
          <p>I practice from a grounded, collaborative stance. I aim to offer clear clinical thinking and practical plans tailored to your life. I maintain confidentiality within professional limits. I do not offer emergency crisis services; if you are in immediate danger, please contact local emergency services or a crisis line right away.</p>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="offers reveal" id="offers">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Ways to work together</h2>
        <p>Different rhythms suit different needs. Below are common options; we can tailor specifics in conversation.</p>
        <div class="cards">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Insight Session</h3>
            <p>A 50-minute appointment to clarify pressing concerns and leave with immediate next steps.</p>
            <p class="price">Single session — $170</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Momentum Package</h3>
            <p>Four sessions spaced according to your pace, with brief messaging between visits to support continuity.</p>
            <p class="price">Four sessions — $620</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Guided Check-ins</h3>
            <p>Monthly 30-minute sessions to maintain progress once you have a plan in place.</p>
            <p class="price">Monthly subscription — $95 / month</p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="planner" aria-labelledby="planner-title">
          <h3 id="planner-title">Session Planner</h3>
          <p>Create a short plan to bring to a session or to try on your own. You can copy the plan or download it as plain text.</p>
          <form id="planner-form">
            <label>Primary concern
              <input name="concern" placeholder="e.g., sleep, worry, decision-making" required>
            </label>
            <label>Three-session goal
              <input name="goal" placeholder="What would you like to change in the next month?" required>
            </label>
            <label>Session rhythm
              <select name="pace">
                <option value="Weekly">Weekly</option>
                <option value="Biweekly">Biweekly</option>
                <option value="Monthly">Monthly</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label>Constraints or notes
              <input name="constraints" placeholder="e.g., evening availability, childcare, short sessions">
            </label>
            <div class="form-row">
              <button type="button" id="build-plan">Create Plan</button>
            </div>
          </form>
          <pre id="plan-output" aria-live="polite" tabindex="0"></pre>
          <div class="plan-actions">
            <button id="copy-plan">Copy Plan</button>
            <button id="download-plan">Download .txt</button>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing reveal" id="pricing">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Fees and administrative notes</h2>
        <p>We accept private pay. If you wish to seek reimbursement, I can provide a superbill. Payment is generally due at the time of service unless previously agreed otherwise.</p>
        <p>Confidentiality is central to our work. There are established legal and ethical limits to confidentiality, such as when there is a risk of harm to self or others or when required by law; I will discuss these boundaries with you.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="testimonials reveal" id="testimonials">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Reflections from people I’ve worked with</h2>
        <blockquote>"A steady, practical approach — each session gave me a few concrete things to try."</blockquote>
        <blockquote>"Thoughtful, direct, and human; helped me see what slightly different choices could do."</blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta reveal">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>When you’re ready</h2>
        <p>If this feels like a useful fit, schedule an initial conversation or ask a question first.</p>
        <a class="primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Start a conversation</a>
        <p class="contact-small">Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> · <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} · {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
      <nav class="footer-nav">
        <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
